{"role":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here is an audit of the **「編輯課程」** flow (the shared `CourseEditForm` inside the edit modal). The product copy does not say 「整筆契約編輯」 in these files; behavior is **one modal titled 「編輯課程」** with one form.\n\n---\n\n## 1. `CourseManagement.vue` — edit modal and save path\n\n**Modal shell (title, form, actions)** — lines 405–432:\n\n```405:432:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue\n    <!-- Edit Course Modal -->\n    <div v-if=\"showEditModal\" class=\"modal-overlay\">\n      <div class=\"modal course-modal\">\n        <h3 class=\"modal-title\">編輯課程</h3>\n        <div class=\"form-section\">\n          <CourseEditForm\n            v-model=\"editForm\"\n            :teachers=\"teachers\"\n            :rooms=\"rooms\"\n            :subjects=\"subjectOptions\"\n            :day-options=\"DAY_OPTIONS\"\n            :time-options=\"TIME_OPTIONS_30\"\n            :settlement-day-options=\"settlementDayOptions\"\n            :show-remaining=\"true\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        ...\n        <div class=\"actions\">\n          <button class=\"ghost\" @click=\"showEditModal = false\">取消</button>\n          <button class=\"primary\" @click=\"submitEdit\">儲存</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n```\n\n**`course-modal` layout** (width / scroll): lines 3771–3777.\n\n**`editCourse`** (builds `editForm` from row `c`; **no `PackageID` branching**): lines 2446–2497.\n\n**`submitEdit`** (Laravel `PUT` then optional second `PUT` for `force_partial_rebuild`): lines 2499–2628.\n\n**Validation before save (CourseManagement):** For the Laravel branch there is **no** client-side check for teacher, days, settlement day, etc. — it goes straight to `fetch` and only shows `alert` on HTTP error. The Supabase branch (lines 2613–2628) also updates without the richer checks used elsewhere for **create**.\n\n**Package-linked courses (`PackageID`):** The list UI shows a 「方案」 tag and 「（方案共用）」 hint for remaining (e.g. lines 171, 217, 320). **`editCourse` / `submitEdit` never read `PackageID` or change fields/disabled state.** Editing is the same as standalone; there is **no in-form explanation** that remaining might be shared at package level.\n\n**Flat vs grouped:** The page only wraps the form in `<div class=\"form-section\">` with **no subsection titles** for the edit modal — grouping is entirely inside `CourseEditForm`.\n\n---\n\n## 2. `CourseEditForm.vue` — fields, structure, props\n\n### Complete list of **user-visible** editable controls (binding → type)\n\n| Field / control | `v-model` / binding | Type in UI |\n|-----------------|---------------------|------------|\n| 科目 | `form.subject` | `<select>` (string from options) |\n| 老師 | `form.teacher_id` | `<select>` (string/number id, empty = \"請選擇\") |\n| 開課日 | `form.first_class_date` | `<input type=\"date\">` |\n| 類型 | `form.class_type` | `<select>` (string enum) |\n| 單堂/每小時費用 | `form.rate_per_30min` | `<input type=\"number\">` |\n| 預設上課時長 | `form.duration_hours` | `<select>` (1–3 step 0.5) |\n| 繳費方式 | `form.payment_type` | `<select>` (`session` \\| `monthly`) |\n| 購買堂數 | `form.sessions_purchased` | `<input type=\"number\">` if `payment_type === 'session'` |\n| 結算日 | `form.settlement_day` | `<select>` (1–31 or null) if monthly |\n| 每月堂數 | `form.monthly_sessions` | `<input type=\"number\">` optional if monthly |\n| 繳費日期 | `form.paid_at` | `<input type=\"date\">` |\n| 剩餘堂數 | `form.remaining_sessions` | `<input type=\"number\">` if `showRemaining` |\n| 固定排課日 | `form.days_of_week` | multi checkbox chips (numeric weekdays) |\n| 每日時段 | `form.day_time_slots[]` | per row: day `<select>` or label, start `<select>`, duration number, end hint, remove |\n| 上課地點 | `form.room_id` | `<select>` (nullable) |\n| 備註 | `form.memo` | `<textarea>` |\n\n**Not shown in template but in reactive form / payload:** `day_of_week`, `start_time`, `end_time`, and emitted **`rate_unit`** (set in watcher from `hasPerDayDuration`, not a visible field). There is **no `billing_mode`** anywhere in this file.\n\n**Conditional / derived UI (line refs):**\n\n- Teacher scope banner: lines 26–28, computed 252–256  \n- `payment_type === 'session'`: lines 70–73  \n- `payment_type === 'monthly'`: lines 75–87  \n- `showRemaining`: lines 96–99  \n- `paid_at` hints: lines 91–93  \n- Per-slot day dropdown vs label: lines 124–132  \n- Label 「每小時費用」 vs 「單堂費用」: lines 47–48, computed 264–270  \n\n**Props and defaults** — lines 190–200:\n\n- `modelValue` (required object)  \n- `teachers`, `rooms`, `subjects`, `dayOptions`, `timeOptions`, `settlementDayOptions` — default `[]`  \n- `showRemaining` — default `false`  \n- `studentGrade` — default `null`  \n\n**`defaultForm`** — lines 204–224.\n\n**Structure:** One `.course-form-grid` — **two-column CSS grid**, single flat reading order; **no headings, cards, or accordions**. Full-width rows use `.span-full` (warning, 固定排課, 教室, 備註). Breakpoint: &lt;720px → one column (lines 593–597).\n\n---\n\n## 3. `StudentsList.vue` — same form?\n\n**Edit modal** — lines 440–463: same **`CourseEditForm`** with `v-model=\"courseForm\"`, same teacher/room/subject/day/time/settlement props, plus **`:student-grade=\"selectedStudent?.grade || selectedStudent?.ClassID || null\"`**.\n\n**Differences vs CourseManagement:**\n\n| Aspect | CourseManagement | StudentsList |\n|--------|------------------|--------------|\n| `:show-remaining` | `true` | **omitted** → default **`false`** → **剩餘堂數欄位不出現** |\n| `:student-grade` | **not passed** | passed → **科系/學段 scope 警告** can show |\n| Modal width | `.course-modal` max-width **560px**, 90vh scroll | inline **`width: 520px`** |\n| Laravel `PUT` body | includes **`remaining_sessions`** (e.g. 2514–2515) | **does not include `remaining_sessions`** (1895–1920); includes **`rate_unit`** (1900) |\n| Post-save sync messaging | Rich (`force_partial_rebuild`, schedule fingerprint, etc.) | Different / shorter branch (1928–1953) |\n\n**`editCourse`** — lines 1704–1753: builds `courseForm` similarly to CourseManagement but **does not set `remaining_sessions`**. Because `CourseEditForm` merges `defaultForm` first, **`remaining_sessions` becomes `0` in the child** until/unless the parent sends it — and the child’s deep watcher **emits `update:modelValue`**, which can **push `remaining_sessions: 0` back into `courseForm`**. That is a **consistency risk** (even though the current StudentsList Laravel `PUT` omits `remaining_sessions`).\n\n---\n\n## 4. Screenshot-describable layout\n\n- **Overlay:** full-screen dimmed backdrop.  \n- **Card:** centered white panel; **CourseManagement** slightly wider max 560px and vertically scrollable; **StudentsList** fixed 520px.  \n- **Header:** bold 「編輯課程」 only — no student name or contract id in the title.  \n- **Body:** dense **2-column grid** of labeled fields (科目 / 老師 / 開課日 / 類型 / 費用 / 時長 / 繳費…); optional **amber banner** under 老師 if scope mismatch.  \n- **Wide block:** weekday **pill toggles**, then **stacked rows** (day + time dropdown + duration + computed end + 移除), then 「＋ 新增時段」.  \n- **Wide block:** 教室 dropdown; **備註** textarea.  \n- **Footer row:** right-aligned optional 「＋ 單次加課」 when `payment_type === 'session'`; then **取消** (ghost) and **儲存** (primary).\n\n---\n\n## 5. UX / product issues (concrete)\n\n1. **No grouping** — Billing, schedule, commercial, and location are **one long flat grid**; no section titles or progressive disclosure.  \n2. **Weak / uneven validation** — No required markers; **CourseManagement `submitEdit`** does not mirror **StudentsList** create checks (teacher, at least one weekday, monthly settlement day). Failures likely **only after submit** via `alert`.  \n3. **No contract context in modal** — Title is generic; **no student name, package name, or 「方案共用」 explanation** in the editor even when `PackageID` exists on the row.  \n4. **Package vs standalone** — **Not handled in edit UI**; risk of users mis-editing shared pool semantics without copy or constraints.  \n5. **Inconsistent behavior across pages** — **剩餘堂數** editable in CourseManagement, **hidden** in StudentsList; **PUT payloads differ** (`remaining_sessions`, `rate_unit`).  \n6. **`remaining_sessions` / `defaultForm` risk on StudentsList** — Missing field on open + child defaults can **clobber** model to `0` via `v-model` sync.  \n7. **`billing_mode`** — Not exposed in this form (user asked); if backend supports it, the UI doesn’t.  \n8. **Feedback** — Hints mainly for `paid_at` and teacher schedule chips; **no inline errors** for invalid combos (e.g. monthly without settlement day on edit in CourseManagement).  \n9. **Success feedback** — `alert()`-based; no non-blocking toast or inline summary.  \n\n---\n\n## 6. Key line number index\n\n| Topic | File | Lines |\n|--------|------|--------|\n| Edit modal markup | `CourseManagement.vue` | 405–432 |\n| `editForm` / baseline refs | `CourseManagement.vue` | 1163–1169 |\n| `scheduleFingerprintForEdit` | `CourseManagement.vue` | 2425–2444 |\n| `editCourse` | `CourseManagement.vue` | 2446–2497 |\n| `submitEdit` (Laravel + fallback) | `CourseManagement.vue` | 2499–2628 |\n| `.course-modal` | `CourseManagement.vue` | 3771–3777 |\n| Form template + grid | `CourseEditForm.vue` | 1–183 |\n| Props / defaults / `defaultForm` | `CourseEditForm.vue` | 190–224 |\n| Emit payload (`rate_unit`, slots) | `CourseEditForm.vue` | 334–352 |\n| Styles (grid, responsive) | `CourseEditForm.vue` | 470–597 |\n| Students edit modal | `StudentsList.vue` | 440–463 |\n| `editCourse` | `StudentsList.vue` | 1704–1753 |\n| `submitCourse` (Laravel PUT) | `StudentsList.vue` | 1887–1965 |\n\nAbsolute paths:  \n`/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue`,  \n`/home/admin/frontend/src/components/CourseEditForm.vue`,  \n`/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/StudentsList.vue`.\n\n[REDACTED]"}]}}